"><span class="hero__role-part">Senior Product Marketer<span class="hero__role-sep" aria-hidden="true">·</span></span><span class="sr-only">, </span><span class="hero__role-part">Fintech, Payments &amp; Gaming</span></p><h1 id="hero-h" tabindex="-1">There’s a <span class="story">story</span> inside your complex product.</h1><div class="hero__lower"><p class="hero__sub">I turn complex products into clear positioning and messaging, then build what helps people get it. From branding and campaigns to websites, videos, apps, and AI projects.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn btn--blue" href="/#work"><span class="btn__text">Explore the work</span><svg class="icon icon--down" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M205.66,149.66l-72,72a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-72-72a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L120,196.69V40a8,8,0,0,1,16,0V196.69l58.34-58.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"/></svg></a><a class="btn btn--ghost" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/kevinswpark" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><svg class="icon icon--brand" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M216,24H40A16,16,0,0,0,24,40V216a16,16,0,0,0,16,16H216a16,16,0,0,0,16-16V40A16,16,0,0,0,216,24Zm0,192H40V40H216V216ZM96,112v64a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V112a8,8,0,0,1,16,0Zm88,28v36a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V140a20,20,0,0,0-40,0v36a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V112a8,8,0,0,1,15.79-1.78A36,36,0,0,1,184,140ZM100,84A12,12,0,1,1,88,72,12,12,0,0,1,100,84Z"/></svg><span class="btn__text">Connect on LinkedIn</span><svg class="icon icon--out" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M200,64V168a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V83.31L69.66,197.66a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L172.69,72H88a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H192A8,8,0,0,1,200,64Z"/></svg><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></div></div></div><a class="hero__card" href="/work/money-layer/" aria-label="Read the case study: Using a visual metaphor to explain ZBD’s role"><span class="card3d" data-tilt><span class="card3d__face"><span class="card3d__top"><span class="card3d__brand">ZBD</span><svg class="icon card3d__go" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M200,64V168a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V83.31L69.66,197.66a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L172.69,72H88a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H192A8,8,0,0,1,200,64Z"/></svg></span><span class="card3d__art"><svg class="lines" viewBox="0 0 480 300" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><g class="lines__thin"><path d="M0 18.0C120.0 18.0 220.8 128.9 300 150.0"/><path d="M0 35.6C120.0 35.6 220.8 131.7 300 150.0"/><path d="M0 53.2C120.0 53.2 220.8 134.5 300 150.0"/><path d="M0 70.8C120.0 70.8 220.8 137.3 300 150.0"/><path d="M0 88.4C120.0 88.4 220.8 140.1 300 150.0"/><path d="M0 106.0C120.0 106.0 220.8 143.0 300 150.0"/><path d="M0 123.6C120.0 123.6 220.8 145.8 300 150.0"/><path d="M0 141.2C120.0 141.2 220.8 148.6 300 150.0"/><path d="M0 158.8C120.0 158.8 220.8 151.4 300 150.0"/><path d="M0 176.4C120.0 176.4 220.8 154.2 300 150.0"/><path d="M0 194.0C120.0 194.0 220.8 157.0 300 150.0"/><path d="M0 211.6C120.0 211.6 220.8 159.9 300 150.0"/><path d="M0 229.2C120.0 229.2 220.8 162.7 300 150.0"/><path d="M0 246.8C120.0 246.8 220.8 165.5 300 150.0"/><path d="M0 264.4C120.0 264.4 220.8 168.3 300 150.0"/><path d="M0 282.0C120.0 282.0 220.8 171.1 300 150.0"/></g><path class="lines__main" d="M300 150.0H480"/><circle class="lines__node" cx="300" cy="150.0" r="5"/></svg></span><span class="card3d__line">The Money Layer for Games</span><span class="card3d__bottom"><span class="card3d__kicker">Case study</span></span><span class="card3d__sheen"></span></span></span></a></div></section><section class="statement wrap" aria-label="Kevin Park"><p class="statement__lead reveal"><span>I</span> <span>get</span> <span>into</span> <span>how</span> <span>a</span> <span>product</span> <span>works,</span> <span>why</span> <span>someone</span> <span>would</span> <span>use</span> <span>it,</span> <span>and</span> <span>what</span> <span>it</span> <span>takes</span> <span>to</span> <span>get</span> <span>them</span> <span>there.</span></p><div class="statement__body"><p>That work can become a brand, a campaign, a product demo, or something people can try for themselves.</p></div></section><section class="work wrap" id="work" aria-labelledby="work-h"><h2 class="h2" id="work-h">Selected work</h2><div class="work__grid"><article class="tile tile--ml" aria-labelledby="tile-ml"><div class="tile__text"><h3 id="tile-ml"><a href="/work/money-layer/">Using a visual metaphor to explain ZBD’s role</a></h3><p class="tile__desc">ZBD offered financial infrastructure for games, but we lacked a consistent way to explain its role. I developed “The Money Layer for Games” to give the company a shared description.</p><p class="result"><span class="result__chip">The Money Layer for Games</span></p><p class="tile__impact">ZBD uses the line on its public website.</p><span class="tile__go" aria-hidden="true">Read the case study<svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M221.66,133.66l-72,72a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L196.69,136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H196.69L138.34,61.66a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32l72,72A8,8,0,0,1,221.66,133.66Z"/></svg></span></div><div class="tile__art panel"><div class="dg-pair" role="img" aria-label="Two states of one diagram. First, a wall stops value moving from a game economy to financial systems. Second, the wall opens into a layer marked ZBD that value can cross."><div class="dg-state"><svg viewBox="0 0 560 350" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><text class="dg-label" x="30" y="44">Game economy</text><text class="dg-label" x="530" y="44" text-anchor="end">Financial systems</text><g class="dg-tokens"><circle cx="78" cy="118" r="11"/><circle cx="118" cy="186" r="11"/><circle cx="70" cy="252" r="11"/><rect x="150" y="106" width="20" height="20" rx="3" transform="rotate(45 160 116)"/><rect x="160" y="232" width="20" height="20" rx="3" transform="rotate(45 170 242)"/></g><g class="dg-accounts"><rect x="404" y="98" width="70" height="42" rx="8"/><rect x="404" y="166" width="70" height="42" rx="8"/><rect x="404" y="234" width="70" height="42" rx="8"/><path d="M404 111h70M404 179h70M404 247h70"/></g><rect class="dg-wall" x="264" y="70" width="32" height="228" rx="10"/><path class="dg-flow dg-flow--blocked" d="M92 118H250"/><path class="dg-stop" d="M255 108v20"/><path class="dg-flow dg-flow--blocked" d="M132 186H250"/><path class="dg-stop" d="M255 176v20"/><path class="dg-flow dg-flow--blocked" d="M84 252H250"/><path class="dg-stop" d="M255 242v20"/></svg><p class="dg-state__cap"><span class="dot dot--stop"></span>A boundary that blocks passage</p></div><div class="dg-state"><svg viewBox="0 0 560 350" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><text class="dg-label" x="30" y="44">Game economy</text><text class="dg-label" x="530" y="44" text-anchor="end">Financial systems</text><g class="dg-tokens"><circle cx="78" cy="118" r="11"/><circle cx="118" cy="186" r="11"/><circle cx="70" cy="252" r="11"/><rect x="150" y="106" width="20" height="20" rx="3" transform="rotate(45 160 116)"/><rect x="160" y="232" width="20" height="20" rx="3" transform="rotate(45 170 242)"/></g><g class="dg-accounts"><rect x="404" y="98" width="70" height="42" rx="8"/><rect x="404" y="166" width="70" height="42" rx="8"/><rect x="404" y="234" width="70" height="42" rx="8"/><path d="M404 111h70M404 179h70M404 247h70"/></g><g class="dg-layer"><rect x="264" y="70" width="32" height="30" rx="8"/><rect x="264" y="138" width="32" height="30" rx="8"/><rect x="264" y="206" width="32" height="30" rx="8"/><rect x="264" y="268" width="32" height="30" rx="8"/></g><text class="dg-label dg-label--layer" x="280" y="336" text-anchor="middle">ZBD</text><path class="dg-flow dg-flow--open" d="M92 118C200 118 230 119 280 119S360 118 394 118"/><path class="dg-head" d="M400.0 118.0l-8.0 -5.0v9.9z"/><path class="dg-flow dg-flow--open" d="M132 186C200 186 230 187 280 187S360 186 394 186"/><path class="dg-head" d="M400.0 186.0l-8.0 -5.0v9.9z"/><path class="dg-flow dg-flow--open" d="M84 252C200 252 230 252 280 252S360 252 394 252"/><path class="dg-head" d="M400.0 252.0l-8.0 -5.0v9.9z"/></svg><p class="dg-state__cap"><span class="dot dot--go"></span>A layer that lets value cross</p></div></div></div></article><article class="tile tile--lc" aria-labelledby="tile-lc"><div class="tile__text"><h3 id="tile-lc"><a href="/work/money-lifecycle/">The Money Lifecycle</a></h3><p class="tile__desc">Explaining how ZBD’s products work together by following money into, through, and out of a game.</p><p class="result result--row"><span class="result__chip">Money In</span><span class="result__chip">Money Through</span><span class="result__chip">Money Out</span></p><p class="tile__impact">Used in ZBD’s messaging framework, sales decks, and public website.</p><span class="tile__go" aria-hidden="true">Read the case study<svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M221.66,133.66l-72,72a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L196.69,136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H196.69L138.34,61.66a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32l72,72A8,8,0,0,1,221.66,133.66Z"/></svg></span></div><div class="tile__art"><svg class="dg-lc" viewBox="-30 0 580 360" role="img" aria-label="A loop with three stages, Money In, Money Through, and Money Out, connected by arrows."><circle class="dg-ring" cx="260" cy="176" r="82"/><path class="dg-arc" d="M292.5 62.6A118 118 0 0 1 374.5 204.5"/><path class="dg-head dg-head--arc" d="M374.0 206.5L371.1 193.4L382.7 196.3z"/><path class="dg-arc" d="M342.0 260.9A118 118 0 0 1 178.0 260.9"/><path class="dg-head dg-head--arc" d="M176.6 259.5L189.4 263.5L181.1 272.1z"/><path class="dg-arc" d="M145.5 204.5A118 118 0 0 1 227.5 62.6"/><path class="dg-head dg-head--arc" d="M229.4 62.0L219.5 71.1L216.2 59.6z"/><circle class="dg-node" cx="260.0" cy="58.0" r="8"/><text class="dg-label dg-label--stage" x="260.0" y="28.0" text-anchor="middle">Money In</text><circle class="dg-node" cx="362.2" cy="235.0" r="8"/><text class="dg-label dg-label--stage" x="378.7" y="264.0" text-anchor="start">Money Through</text><circle class="dg-node" cx="157.8" cy="235.0" r="8"/><text class="dg-label dg-label--stage" x="141.3" y="264.0" text-anchor="end">Money Out</text></svg></div></article><article class="tile tile--wb" aria-labelledby="tile-wb"><div class="tile__text"><h3 id="tile-wb"><a href="/work/wirebarley/">Driving tech adoption (and how I changed customer behaviors)</a></h3><p class="tile__desc">Help Korean American customers aged 50+ complete their first transfer with WireBarley. Only about 20% of sign-ups in this group reached that point.</p><p class="result"><span class="result__chip">Korean-language TV commercial</span></p><p class="tile__impact">In the period after the commercial aired, sign-up-to-first-transfer conversion in this group rose to nearly 50%.</p><span class="tile__go" aria-hidden="true">Read the case study<svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M221.66,133.66l-72,72a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L196.69,136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H196.69L138.34,61.66a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32l72,72A8,8,0,0,1,221.66,133.66Z"/></svg></span></div><div class="tile__art"><ol class="mini-story" aria-label="Commercial storyboard"><li><span class="mini-board__n">1</span><span class="mini-board__t">The familiar routine</span></li><li><span class="mini-board__n">2</span><span class="mini-board__t">A new option</span></li><li><span class="mini-board__n">3</span><span class="mini-board__t">Someone to guide him</span></li><li><span class="mini-board__n">4</span><span class="mini-board__t">Confidence through completion</span></li></ol></div></article></div></section><section class="about wrap" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-h"><div class="about__row about__row--open"><div class="about__side"><h2 class="h2 about__h" id="about-h">About</h2></div><div class="about__main"><p class="about__lead"><span class="about__lead-line">I help people understand new technology.</span> <span class="about__lead-line">The more complicated, the better.</span></p><div class="about__prose"><p>Hello, I’m Kevin. I’m a product marketer, startup junkie, 0-to-1 builder, and often the person connecting the dots when things are broken, both in and outside of work.</p><p>I happened to start my career in fintech, and somehow, I’ve become a money person. How money works, what it means to people, and what gets in the way of making it work better in our lives. That’s where I’ve spent most of my time and curiosity.</p><p>I believe money should be easier to understand, more approachable, and accessible to everyone. Like many families, mine had its share of money worries, and sometimes those worries took the joy out of things that should’ve been simple. I’ve seen how much money shapes our everyday lives, and I want to make the world a little more money-friendly.</p><p>I find the greatest joy in making things easier for people. I’ll happily dig into the technical details of how money moves, why it moves, and who gets it. But at the end of the day, I always come back to the same question: “So what? Why should anyone care?”</p></div></div></div><div class="about__row"><div class="about__side"><h3 class="about__sub" id="about-beyond-h">Beyond the work</h3></div><div class="about__main"><div class="about__prose"><p>I’ve called South Korea, Canada, and the United States home at different points in my life. And lately, Tokyo has been making a pretty strong case for joining that list. I’m also picking up Japanese as my third language.</p><p>People who know me well would probably have very different answers about which cultural bucket I fit into. I’m Canadian by nationality, Korean by nuance, American by drive, and Japanese by taste. I enjoy the blend, borrowing bits and pieces from different cultures and mixing them into my own melting pot of thoughts.</p><p>I take pride in simplifying problems at work and outside of it, and finding solutions that actually stick. I like being the person people come to when something doesn’t make sense or just isn’t working. And there’s something pretty great about knowing I’ve made someone’s day a little easier.</p></div></div></div><div class="about__row"><div class="about__side"><h3 class="about__sub" id="about-expect-h">What you can expect</h3></div><div class="about__main about__main--expect"><ul class="expect" aria-labelledby="about-expect-h"><li><span class="expect__phrase">Hard work.</span> <span class="expect__phrase expect__phrase--slow">Long thought processes.</span> <span class="expect__phrase expect__phrase--fast">Fastest execution.</span></li><li><span class="expect__phrase">Cool branding.</span> <span class="expect__phrase">Good conversations.</span> <span class="expect__phrase">Stellar ideas.</span></li><li><span class="expect__phrase">Diligence.</span> <span class="expect__phrase">A human touch.</span> <span class="expect__phrase">Vibe coding things that vibe.</span></li></ul></div></div></section><section class="exp wrap" id="experience" aria-labelledby="exp-h"><h2 class="h2" id="exp-h">Experience</h2><p class="exp__profile">I’ve worked on product marketing for gaming payments, digital banking, and cross-border remittances.</p><ol class="roles"><li class="role"><p class="role__when"><time>May 2025</time><span class="sr-only"> to </span><svg class="icon role__arrow" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M221.66,133.66l-72,72a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L196.69,136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H196.69L138.34,61.66a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32l72,72A8,8,0,0,1,221.66,133.66Z"/></svg><time>Present</time></p><div class="role__main"><h3 class="role__title">Senior Product Marketing Manager<span class="role__at">ZBD</span></h3><p class="role__place">Remote</p><ul class="tags"><li>Gaming fintech infrastructure</li><li>B2B product marketing</li><li>payments and rewards platform</li></ul><ul class="role__bullets"><li>Developed “The Money Layer for Games” positioning and the messaging framework for ZBD’s four-product suite, with branding work that also supported its Series C fundraising.</li><li>Led the website copy rewrite and product naming work, incorporating feedback from business development and industry events.</li><li>Created interactive demos and product videos to show how ZBD’s infrastructure works inside a game.</li></ul></div></li><li class="role"><p class="role__when"><time>Feb 2024</time><span class="sr-only"> to </span><svg class="icon role__arrow" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M221.66,133.66l-72,72a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L196.69,136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H196.69L138.34,61.66a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32l72,72A8,8,0,0,1,221.66,133.66Z"/></svg><time>Jan 2025</time></p><div class="role__main"><h3 class="role__title">Product Marketing Manager<span class="role__at">Finfare</span></h3><p class="role__place">Irvine, CA</p><ul class="tags"><li>Digital Banking & Investments</li><li>GTM Strategy</li><li>Consumer & Merchant Growth</li></ul><ul class="role__bullets"><li>Led go-to-market for digital banking and automated investing products, informed by <mark class="fig">30+</mark> customer interviews and six customer personas.</li><li>Created the messaging framework and sales materials for Finfare Rewards, supporting a network of <mark class="fig">3,000+</mark> merchant partners.</li><li>Led a 20-page website redesign with Product and UX. Engagement rose <mark class="fig">36%</mark> and conversion rose <mark class="fig">24%</mark>.</li></ul></div></li><li class="role"><p class="role__when"><time>June 2020</time><span class="sr-only"> to </span><svg class="icon role__arrow" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M221.66,133.66l-72,72a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L196.69,136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H196.69L138.34,61.66a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32l72,72A8,8,0,0,1,221.66,133.66Z"/></svg><time>Jan 2024</time></p><div class="role__main"><h3 class="role__title">Product Marketing Manager<span class="role__at">WireBarley</span></h3><p class="role__place">Los Angeles, CA</p><ul class="tags"><li>Cross-Border Payments</li><li>B2C Growth</li><li>0 to 1</li></ul><ul class="role__bullets"><li>Scaled the Nepal corridor to <mark class="fig">$5M</mark> in peak weekly remittance volume, with <mark class="fig">300%</mark> year-over-year transaction growth.</li><li>Led bilingual campaigns that drove <mark class="fig">$40M</mark> in holiday remittance volume. WireBarley reached the leading market position among Korean Americans by 2023.</li><li>Delivered <mark class="fig">300%</mark> year-over-year US growth while operating within <mark class="fig">40%</mark> of the previous year’s North American marketing budget.</li><li>Built executive dashboards (Tableau, R) to guide product, retention, and expansion decisions.</li></ul></div></li></ol><div class="exp__extra"><div class="card"><h3 class="card__h">Education</h3><p>Bachelor of Commerce, UBC Sauder School of Business, Vancouver, BC</p></div><div class="card card--wide"><h3 class="card__h">Skills</h3><ul class="chips"><li>Product Marketing</li><li>Go-to-Market Strategy</li><li>Product Positioning</li><li>Messaging Frameworks</li><li>ICP Segmentation</li><li>Sales Enablement</li><li>Competitive Intelligence</li><li>Product Launch</li><li>Fintech and Payments</li><li>Cross-Functional Leadership</li><li>Tableau</li><li>Excel</li><li>R</li><li>Notion</li><li>Bilingual (English / Korean)</li></ul></div></div></section><section class="closing wrap" aria-labelledby="closing"><div class="closing__card"><span class="closing__glow" aria-hidden="true"></span><h2 class="closing__h" id="closing">Let’s talk.</h2><a class="btn btn--white" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/kevinswpark" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><svg class="icon icon--brand" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M216,24H40A16,16,0,0,0,24,40V216a16,16,0,0,0,16,16H216a16,16,0,0,0,16-16V40A16,16,0,0,0,216,24Zm0,192H40V40H216V216ZM96,112v64a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V112a8,8,0,0,1,16,0Zm88,28v36a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V140a20,20,0,0,0-40,0v36a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V112a8,8,0,0,1,15.79-1.78A36,36,0,0,1,184,140ZM100,84A12,12,0,1,1,88,72,12,12,0,0,1,100,84Z"/></svg><span class="btn__text">Connect on LinkedIn</span><svg class="icon icon--out" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M200,64V168a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V83.31L69.66,197.66a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L172.69,72H88a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H192A8,8,0,0,1,200,64Z"/></svg><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></div></section></main><footer class="foot wrap"><div class="foot__row"><span class="logo" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64"><rect width="64" height="64" rx="16" fill="url(#kp-grad-v)"/><path d="M12 22C26 22 30 32 38 32M12 42C26 42 30 32 38 32" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-opacity=".7" stroke-width="3.5"/><path d="M38 32H52" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="5.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span><span>© 2026 Kevin Park</span><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/kevinswpark" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">linkedin.com/in/kevinswpark<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></div></footer><dialog class="zoom" id="zoom" aria-labelledby="zoom-title"><div class="zoom__bar"><p class="zoom__title" id="zoom-title"></p><button class="zoom__close" type="button" aria-label="Close"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M205.66,194.34a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,11.32L128,139.31,61.66,205.66a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L116.69,128,50.34,61.66A8,8,0,0,1,61.66,50.34L128,116.69l66.34-66.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32L139.31,128Z"/></svg></button></div><div class="zoom__body"></div></dialog></body></html>
