-<!doctype html><html lang="en" data-mode="static"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover"><title>Financial planner | Kevin Park</title><meta name="description" content="A free starter financial plan for people who don’t think of themselves as money people. Build a budget, an emergency fund target, and a list of what to do next."><meta name="color-scheme" content="dark"><meta name="theme-color" content="#08080C"><meta property="og:type" content="website"><meta property="og:title" content="Financial planner | Kevin Park"><meta property="og:description" content="A free starter financial plan for people who don’t think of themselves as money people. Build a budget, an emergency fund target, and a list of what to do next."><meta property="og:locale" content="en_US"><meta property="og:image" content="https://kevinpark.xyz/assets/og.png"><meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"><meta property="og:image:height" content="630"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"><link rel="icon" href="/assets/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"><link rel="preload" href="/assets/fonts/mona-sans-latin-standard-normal.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/fonts/fonts.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/site.css"><script src="/assets/site.js" defer></script><link rel="canonical" href="https://kevinpark.xyz/tools/financial-planner/"><meta property="og:url" content="https://kevinpark.xyz/tools/financial-planner/"><script src="/assets/tools/col-data.js" defer></script><script src="/assets/tools/planner.js" defer></script></head><body><svg class="kp-defs" width="0" height="0" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><defs><linearGradient id="kp-grad-h" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="0"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#3D7BFF"/><stop offset=".45" stop-color="#8B5CF6"/><stop offset=".8" stop-color="#FF3D8B"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#FFB84D"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id="kp-grad-v" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#3D7BFF"/><stop offset=".5" stop-color="#8B5CF6"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#FF3D8B"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id="kp-grad-line" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse" x1="70" y1="0" x2="470" y2="0"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#3D7BFF"/><stop offset=".55" stop-color="#8B5CF6"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#FF3D8B"/></linearGradient></defs></svg><a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a><header class="nav"><nav class="nav__inner" aria-label="Main"><a class="nav__brand" href="/"><span class="logo" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64"><rect width="64" height="64" rx="16" fill="url(#kp-grad-v)"/><path d="M12 22C26 22 30 32 38 32M12 42C26 42 30 32 38 32" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-opacity=".7" stroke-width="3.5"/><path d="M38 32H52" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="5.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span><span>Kevin Park</span></a><div class="nav__links"><a href="/#work">Work</a><a href="/#about" data-nav="about">About</a><a href="/#experience" data-nav="experience">Experience</a><div class="tools is-current" data-tools><button class="tools__btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="tools-menu">Tools<svg class="icon tools__caret" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"/></svg></button><div class="tools__panel" id="tools-menu" hidden><p class="sr-only">Tools menu</p><ul class="tools__list"><li><a class="tools__item" href="/tools/financial-planner/" aria-current="page"><span class="tools__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M80,120h96a8,8,0,0,0,8-8V64a8,8,0,0,0-8-8H80a8,8,0,0,0-8,8v48A8,8,0,0,0,80,120Zm8-48h80v32H88ZM200,24H56A16,16,0,0,0,40,40V216a16,16,0,0,0,16,16H200a16,16,0,0,0,16-16V40A16,16,0,0,0,200,24Zm0,192H56V40H200ZM100,148a12,12,0,1,1-12-12A12,12,0,0,1,100,148Zm40,0a12,12,0,1,1-12-12A12,12,0,0,1,140,148Zm40,0a12,12,0,1,1-12-12A12,12,0,0,1,180,148Zm-80,40a12,12,0,1,1-12-12A12,12,0,0,1,100,188Zm40,0a12,12,0,1,1-12-12A12,12,0,0,1,140,188Zm40,0a12,12,0,1,1-12-12A12,12,0,0,1,180,188Z"/></svg></span><span class="tools__text"><span class="tools__title">Financial planner</span><span class="tools__desc">A starter money plan in about 10 minutes</span></span></a></li></ul></div></div></div><a class="btn btn--blue btn--compact" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/kevinswpark" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><svg class="icon icon--brand" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M216,24H40A16,16,0,0,0,24,40V216a16,16,0,0,0,16,16H216a16,16,0,0,0,16-16V40A16,16,0,0,0,216,24Zm0,192H40V40H216V216ZM96,112v64a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V112a8,8,0,0,1,16,0Zm88,28v36a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V140a20,20,0,0,0-40,0v36a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V112a8,8,0,0,1,15.79-1.78A36,36,0,0,1,184,140ZM100,84A12,12,0,1,1,88,72,12,12,0,0,1,100,84Z"/></svg><span class="btn__text">Connect on LinkedIn</span><svg class="icon icon--out" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M200,64V168a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V83.31L69.66,197.66a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L172.69,72H88a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H192A8,8,0,0,1,200,64Z"/></svg><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></nav></header><main id="main" tabindex="-1" class="fp-page"><header class="art-head"><div class="band band--article" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="wrap art-head__in"><h1 id="title" tabindex="-1">A starter financial plan for people who aren’t money people</h1><p class="deck">Answer a few questions about your paycheck, your bills, and what you’re saving for. You’ll leave with a budget, an emergency fund target, and a short list of what to do next.</p><ul class="facts"><li><span class="facts__k">Time</span><span class="facts__v">About 10 minutes</span></li><li><span class="facts__k">Cost</span><span class="facts__v">Free</span></li><li><span class="facts__k">Your answers</span><span class="facts__v">Stay in this browser</span></li></ul></div></header><div class="wrap fp" data-fp><nav class="fp-rail" aria-label="Your plan"><p class="rail__h">Your plan</p><ol><li><button class="fp-rail__btn" type="button" data-go="pay" disabled><span class="fp-rail__n" aria-hidden="true"><span class="fp-rail__num">1</span><svg class="icon fp-rail__check" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"/></svg></span><span class="fp-rail__t">Paycheck</span></button></li><li><button class="fp-rail__btn" type="button" data-go="bills" disabled><span class="fp-rail__n" aria-hidden="true"><span class="fp-rail__num">2</span><svg class="icon fp-rail__check" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"/></svg></span><span class="fp-rail__t">Bills</span></button></li><li><button class="fp-rail__btn" type="button" data-go="budget" disabled><span class="fp-rail__n" aria-hidden="true"><span class="fp-rail__num">3</span><svg class="icon fp-rail__check" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"/></svg></span><span class="fp-rail__t">Budget</span></button></li><li><button class="fp-rail__btn" type="button" data-go="safety" disabled><span class="fp-rail__n" aria-hidden="true"><span class="fp-rail__num">4</span><svg class="icon fp-rail__check" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"/></svg></span><span class="fp-rail__t">Safety net</span></button></li><li><button class="fp-rail__btn" type="button" data-go="goals" disabled><span class="fp-rail__n" aria-hidden="true"><span class="fp-rail__num">5</span><svg class="icon fp-rail__check" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"/></svg></span><span class="fp-rail__t">Goals</span></button></li><li><button class="fp-rail__btn" type="button" data-go="retire" disabled><span class="fp-rail__n" aria-hidden="true"><span class="fp-rail__num">6</span><svg class="icon fp-rail__check" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"/></svg></span><span class="fp-rail__t">Retirement</span></button></li><li><button class="fp-rail__btn" type="button" data-go="invest" disabled><span class="fp-rail__n" aria-hidden="true"><span class="fp-rail__num">7</span><svg class="icon fp-rail__check" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"/></svg></span><span class="fp-rail__t">Investing</span></button></li><li><button class="fp-rail__btn" type="button" data-go="plan" disabled><span class="fp-rail__n" aria-hidden="true"><span class="fp-rail__num">8</span><svg class="icon fp-rail__check" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"/></svg></span><span class="fp-rail__t">Your plan</span></button></li></ol><button class="fp-link fp-rail__reset" type="button" data-reset><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M224,128a96,96,0,0,1-94.71,96H128A95.38,95.38,0,0,1,62.1,197.8a8,8,0,0,1,11-11.63A80,80,0,1,0,71.43,71.39a3.07,3.07,0,0,1-.26.25L44.59,96H72a8,8,0,0,1,0,16H24a8,8,0,0,1-8-8V56a8,8,0,0,1,16,0V85.8L60.25,60A96,96,0,0,1,224,128Z"/></svg><span>Start over</span></button></nav><div class="fp-flow"><p class="fp-note">I want money to feel less intimidating. This planner uses the rules of thumb most planners start with and shows the math behind each one. It’s for learning, so it never names a fund, a stock, or a brokerage.</p><section class="fp-step" id="fp-step-pay" data-step="pay" aria-labelledby="fp-step-pay-h"><h2 class="fp-step__h" id="fp-step-pay-h" tabindex="-1">Start with your paycheck</h2><p class="fp-step__lead">Everything in your plan is sized to the money that actually reaches your account.</p><div class="fp-step__body"><div class="fp-field "><label class="fp-label" for="fp-take_home">How much lands in your bank account each month?</label><p class="fp-help" id="fp-take_home-help">Use take-home pay, after taxes and anything your employer takes out. Your paystub calls it net pay.</p><div class="fp-money"><span class="fp-money__sign" aria-hidden="true">$</span><input class="fp-input" id="fp-take_home" name="take_home" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="fp-take_home-help" data-money></div></div><fieldset class="fp-field"><legend class="fp-label">How steady is your pay?</legend><div class="fp-chips fp-chips--stack"><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="pay_type" value="steady"><span>About the same every paycheck</span></label><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="pay_type" value="hourly"><span>Mostly steady, but hours change</span></label><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="pay_type" value="variable"><span>It changes a lot (tips, commission, freelance)</span></label></div></fieldset><div class="fp-field "><label class="fp-label" for="fp-gross">What do you earn in a year before taxes?</label><p class="fp-help" id="fp-gross-help">Optional. It sets your tax bracket and your retirement account limits.</p><div class="fp-money"><span class="fp-money__sign" aria-hidden="true">$</span><input class="fp-input" id="fp-gross" name="gross" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="fp-gross-help" data-money></div></div><fieldset class="fp-field"><legend class="fp-label">How do you file taxes?</legend><div class="fp-chips"><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="filing" value="single"><span>Single</span></label><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="filing" value="joint"><span>Married, filing jointly</span></label></div></fieldset><div class="fp-field fp-field--zip"><label class="fp-label" for="fp-zip">What’s your ZIP code?</label><p class="fp-help" id="fp-zip-help">We use it to compare prices where you live with the US average.</p><div class="fp-money fp-money--plain"><input class="fp-input" id="fp-zip" name="zip" type="text" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="postal-code" maxlength="5" aria-describedby="fp-zip-help"></div></div><div class="fp-out" data-out="area" aria-live="polite"></div><fieldset class="fp-field" aria-describedby="fp-tier-help"><legend class="fp-label">Cost of living</legend><p class="fp-help" id="fp-tier-help">Change this if it doesn’t match how expensive your area feels.</p><div class="fp-chips"><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="tier" value="low"><span>Lower cost</span></label><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="tier" value="mid"><span>Medium cost</span></label><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="tier" value="high"><span>Higher cost</span></label></div></fieldset></div><div class="fp-nav"><span class="fp-nav__count">Step 1 of 8</span><button class="btn btn--blue" type="button" data-next><span class="btn__text">Next</span><svg class="icon icon--next" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M221.66,133.66l-72,72a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L196.69,136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H196.69L138.34,61.66a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32l72,72A8,8,0,0,1,221.66,133.66Z"/></svg></button></div></section><section class="fp-step" id="fp-step-bills" data-step="bills" aria-labelledby="fp-step-bills-h"><h2 class="fp-step__h" id="fp-step-bills-h" tabindex="-1">List the bills you can’t skip</h2><p class="fp-step__lead">These are the costs you’d still pay if your income stopped tomorrow. Their total sets your emergency fund.</p><div class="fp-step__body"><fieldset class="fp-field"><legend class="fp-label">Monthly bills</legend><p class="fp-help" id="fp-bills-help">Enter $0 for anything that doesn’t apply. A three-month average works for bills that change.</p><div class="fp-bills"><div class="fp-bill"><label class="fp-bill__k" for="fp-b-rent">Rent or mortgage<span class="fp-bill__hint">Include HOA fees and renter’s insurance</span></label><div class="fp-money fp-money--sm"><span class="fp-money__sign" aria-hidden="true">$</span><input class="fp-input" id="fp-b-rent" name="b_rent" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" data-money></div></div><div class="fp-bill"><label class="fp-bill__k" for="fp-b-utilities">Utilities<span class="fp-bill__hint">Electric, gas, water, trash</span></label><div class="fp-money fp-money--sm"><span class="fp-money__sign" aria-hidden="true">$</span><input class="fp-input" id="fp-b-utilities" name="b_utilities" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" data-money></div></div><div class="fp-bill"><label class="fp-bill__k" for="fp-b-phone">Phone and internet</label><div class="fp-money fp-money--sm"><span class="fp-money__sign" aria-hidden="true">$</span><input class="fp-input" id="fp-b-phone" name="b_phone" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" data-money></div></div><div class="fp-bill"><label class="fp-bill__k" for="fp-b-car">Car payment and insurance</label><div class="fp-money fp-money--sm"><span class="fp-money__sign" aria-hidden="true">$</span><input class="fp-input" id="fp-b-car" name="b_car" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" data-money></div></div><div class="fp-bill"><label class="fp-bill__k" for="fp-b-transport">Gas and transit</label><div class="fp-money fp-money--sm"><span class="fp-money__sign" aria-hidden="true">$</span><input class="fp-input" id="fp-b-transport" name="b_transport" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" data-money></div></div><div class="fp-bill"><label class="fp-bill__k" for="fp-b-health">Health insurance<span class="fp-bill__hint">Only if it isn’t already taken out of your paycheck</span></label><div class="fp-money fp-money--sm"><span class="fp-money__sign" aria-hidden="true">$</span><input class="fp-input" id="fp-b-health" name="b_health" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" data-money></div></div><div class="fp-bill"><label class="fp-bill__k" for="fp-b-groceries">Groceries<span class="fp-bill__hint">Food at home, not restaurants</span></label><div class="fp-money fp-money--sm"><span class="fp-money__sign" aria-hidden="true">$</span><input class="fp-input" id="fp-b-groceries" name="b_groceries" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" data-money></div></div><div class="fp-bill"><label class="fp-bill__k" for="fp-b-childcare">Childcare and support</label><div class="fp-money fp-money--sm"><span class="fp-money__sign" aria-hidden="true">$</span><input class="fp-input" id="fp-b-childcare" name="b_childcare" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" data-money></div></div><div class="fp-bill"><label class="fp-bill__k" for="fp-b-debt_min">Minimum debt payments<span class="fp-bill__hint">Student loans, car loans, card minimums</span></label><div class="fp-money fp-money--sm"><span class="fp-money__sign" aria-hidden="true">$</span><input class="fp-input" id="fp-b-debt_min" name="b_debt_min" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" data-money></div></div><div class="fp-bill"><label class="fp-bill__k" for="fp-b-other">Other must-pays<span class="fp-bill__hint">Medication, pet care, anything you can’t pause</span></label><div class="fp-money fp-money--sm"><span class="fp-money__sign" aria-hidden="true">$</span><input class="fp-input" id="fp-b-other" name="b_other" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" data-money></div></div></div></fieldset><div class="fp-out" data-out="bills" aria-live="polite"></div><fieldset class="fp-field"><legend class="fp-label">Do you carry a credit card balance from month to month?</legend><div class="fp-chips"><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="card" value="yes"><span>Yes</span></label><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="card" value="no"><span>No</span></label></div></fieldset><div class="fp-pair" data-show="card=yes" hidden><div class="fp-field "><label class="fp-label" for="fp-card_balance">Balance</label><div class="fp-money"><span class="fp-money__sign" aria-hidden="true">$</span><input class="fp-input" id="fp-card_balance" name="card_balance" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" data-money></div></div><div class="fp-field "><label class="fp-label" for="fp-card_apr">Interest rate (APR)</label><p class="fp-help" id="fp-card_apr-help">It’s on your statement, usually around 20% or more</p><div class="fp-money fp-money--suffix"><input class="fp-input" id="fp-card_apr" name="card_apr" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="fp-card_apr-help"><span class="fp-money__suffix" aria-hidden="true">%</span></div></div></div></div><div class="fp-nav"><button class="btn btn--ghost" type="button" data-back><svg class="icon icon--back" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H59.31l58.35,58.34a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,11.32l-72-72a8,8,0,0,1,0-11.32l72-72a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32L59.31,120H216A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"/></svg><span class="btn__text">Back</span></button><span class="fp-nav__count">Step 2 of 8</span><button class="btn btn--blue" type="button" data-next><span class="btn__text">Next</span><svg class="icon icon--next" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M221.66,133.66l-72,72a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L196.69,136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H196.69L138.34,61.66a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32l72,72A8,8,0,0,1,221.66,133.66Z"/></svg></button></div></section><section class="fp-step" id="fp-step-budget" data-step="budget" aria-labelledby="fp-step-budget-h"><h2 class="fp-step__h" id="fp-step-budget-h" tabindex="-1">Split your paycheck three ways</h2><p class="fp-step__lead">The 50/30/20 rule puts half of take-home pay toward needs, 30% toward wants, and 20% toward savings. Where you live moves those numbers.</p><div class="fp-step__body"><div class="fp-out" data-out="split" aria-live="polite"></div><fieldset class="fp-field"><legend class="fp-label">Your split</legend><p class="fp-help" id="fp-split-help">Drag to change it. Your three numbers always add up to 100%.</p><div class="fp-sliders"><div class="fp-slider fp-slider--needs"><label for="fp-s-needs"><span class="fp-slider__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Needs<output class="fp-slider__v" data-split="needs"></output></label><input type="range" id="fp-s-needs" name="s_needs" min="0" max="100" step="1"></div><div class="fp-slider fp-slider--wants"><label for="fp-s-wants"><span class="fp-slider__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Wants<output class="fp-slider__v" data-split="wants"></output></label><input type="range" id="fp-s-wants" name="s_wants" min="0" max="100" step="1"></div><div class="fp-slider fp-slider--save"><label for="fp-s-save"><span class="fp-slider__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Savings and extra debt payments<output class="fp-slider__v" data-split="save"></output></label><input type="range" id="fp-s-save" name="s_save" min="0" max="100" step="1"></div></div><button class="fp-link" type="button" data-reset-split><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M224,128a96,96,0,0,1-94.71,96H128A95.38,95.38,0,0,1,62.1,197.8a8,8,0,0,1,11-11.63A80,80,0,1,0,71.43,71.39a3.07,3.07,0,0,1-.26.25L44.59,96H72a8,8,0,0,1,0,16H24a8,8,0,0,1-8-8V56a8,8,0,0,1,16,0V85.8L60.25,60A96,96,0,0,1,224,128Z"/></svg><span data-reset-label></span></button></fieldset><div class="fp-out" data-out="budget-check" aria-live="polite"></div></div><div class="fp-nav"><button class="btn btn--ghost" type="button" data-back><svg class="icon icon--back" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H59.31l58.35,58.34a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,11.32l-72-72a8,8,0,0,1,0-11.32l72-72a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32L59.31,120H216A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"/></svg><span class="btn__text">Back</span></button><span class="fp-nav__count">Step 3 of 8</span><button class="btn btn--blue" type="button" data-next><span class="btn__text">Next</span><svg class="icon icon--next" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M221.66,133.66l-72,72a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L196.69,136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H196.69L138.34,61.66a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32l72,72A8,8,0,0,1,221.66,133.66Z"/></svg></button></div></section><section class="fp-step" id="fp-step-safety" data-step="safety" aria-labelledby="fp-step-safety-h"><h2 class="fp-step__h" id="fp-step-safety-h" tabindex="-1">Build your safety net</h2><p class="fp-step__lead">An emergency fund keeps one bad month from turning into credit card debt. Yours depends on how steady your income is.</p><div class="fp-step__body"><fieldset class="fp-field"><legend class="fp-label">How many paychecks support your household?</legend><div class="fp-chips"><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="incomes" value="1"><span>One</span></label><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="incomes" value="2"><span>Two or more</span></label></div></fieldset><fieldset class="fp-field" aria-describedby="fp-dependents-help"><legend class="fp-label">Does anyone depend on your income?</legend><p class="fp-help" id="fp-dependents-help">Kids, a partner, or a parent you help support</p><div class="fp-chips"><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="dependents" value="yes"><span>Yes</span></label><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="dependents" value="no"><span>No</span></label></div></fieldset><fieldset class="fp-field" aria-describedby="fp-own-help"><legend class="fp-label">Do you own a home?</legend><p class="fp-help" id="fp-own-help">Owners have more repair surprises</p><div class="fp-chips"><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="own" value="yes"><span>Yes</span></label><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="own" value="no"><span>No</span></label></div></fieldset><fieldset class="fp-field" aria-describedby="fp-risk_job-help"><legend class="fp-label">Is your job hard to replace quickly?</legend><p class="fp-help" id="fp-risk_job-help">Layoffs are common in your field, or you have a health condition</p><div class="fp-chips"><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="risk_job" value="yes"><span>Yes</span></label><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="risk_job" value="no"><span>No</span></label></div></fieldset><div class="fp-out" data-out="target" aria-live="polite"></div><div class="fp-field "><label class="fp-label" for="fp-saved">How much do you have saved for emergencies right now?</label><p class="fp-help" id="fp-saved-help">Cash you could reach in a day or two. Not retirement accounts.</p><div class="fp-money"><span class="fp-money__sign" aria-hidden="true">$</span><input class="fp-input" id="fp-saved" name="saved" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="fp-saved-help" data-money></div></div><div class="fp-field "><label class="fp-label" for="fp-monthly_save">How much can you put toward it each month?</label><p class="fp-help" id="fp-monthly_save-help">We started with part of your savings budget. Adjust it to what feels real.</p><div class="fp-money"><span class="fp-money__sign" aria-hidden="true">$</span><input class="fp-input" id="fp-monthly_save" name="monthly_save" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="fp-monthly_save-help" data-money></div></div><div class="fp-out" data-out="progress" aria-live="polite"></div><div class="fp-sub"><h3 class="fp-h3">Where to keep it</h3><p class="fp-p">Keep your emergency fund in a high-yield savings account. The best ones pay more than 10 times the national average, and the money is still there when you need it.</p><ul class="fp-checks"><li><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"/></svg><span>Insured by the FDIC (banks) or NCUA (credit unions), up to $250,000</span></li><li><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"/></svg><span>No monthly fee and no minimum balance to earn the rate</span></li><li><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"/></svg><span>A rate that lasts, not a six-month promo</span></li><li><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"/></svg><span>No direct deposit or monthly deposit requirement you can’t meet</span></li><li><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"/></svg><span>Transfers to checking in one or two business days</span></li></ul><div class="fp-table-wrap"><table class="fp-table"><caption>Rates change often. Check the bank’s site before you open an account. <a href="https://www.nerdwallet.com/banking/best/high-yield-online-savings-accounts" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">NerdWallet, rates as of November 6, 2026<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Account</th><th scope="col">APY</th><th scope="col">Minimum to earn it</th><th scope="col">Fine print</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Pibank Savings</th><td class="fp-apy">4.40%</td><td>$0</td><td>No monthly fee</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Peak Bank</th><td class="fp-apy">4.27%</td><td>$0</td><td>$100 to open</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">EverBank Performance Savings</th><td class="fp-apy">4.20%</td><td>$0</td><td>No requirements listed</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Happen Bank LevelUp Savings</th><td class="fp-apy">4.20%</td><td>$0</td><td>Needs $250 or more deposited each cycle, otherwise 3.00%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">SoFi Checking and Savings</th><td class="fp-apy">Up to 4.40%</td><td>$0</td><td>3.30% base needs direct deposit or $5,000 in deposits every 31 days</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Openbank High Yield Savings</th><td class="fp-apy">Up to 4.35%</td><td>$500</td><td>Six-month rate for new customers</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Marcus by Goldman Sachs</th><td class="fp-apy">3.50%</td><td>$0</td><td>No monthly fee</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Capital One 360 Performance Savings</th><td class="fp-apy">3.20%</td><td>$0</td><td>No monthly fee</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class="fp-nav"><button class="btn btn--ghost" type="button" data-back><svg class="icon icon--back" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H59.31l58.35,58.34a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,11.32l-72-72a8,8,0,0,1,0-11.32l72-72a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32L59.31,120H216A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"/></svg><span class="btn__text">Back</span></button><span class="fp-nav__count">Step 4 of 8</span><button class="btn btn--blue" type="button" data-next><span class="btn__text">Next</span><svg class="icon icon--next" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M221.66,133.66l-72,72a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L196.69,136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H196.69L138.34,61.66a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32l72,72A8,8,0,0,1,221.66,133.66Z"/></svg></button></div></section><section class="fp-step" id="fp-step-goals" data-step="goals" aria-labelledby="fp-step-goals-h"><h2 class="fp-step__h" id="fp-step-goals-h" tabindex="-1">Plan for the big stuff</h2><p class="fp-step__lead">Money you need within a few years should stay out of the stock market. Money you won’t touch for a long time can take more risk.</p><div class="fp-step__body"><div class="fp-field"><p class="fp-label" id="fp-goals-l">What are you saving for?</p><p class="fp-help" id="fp-goals-help">Add anything you’ll need a lump sum for. Skip this if nothing comes to mind.</p><div class="fp-adds" role="group" aria-labelledby="fp-goals-l"><button class="fp-add" type="button" data-add-goal="Wedding"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H136v80a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h80V40a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v80h80A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"/></svg><span>Wedding</span></button><button class="fp-add" type="button" data-add-goal="Home down payment"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H136v80a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h80V40a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v80h80A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"/></svg><span>Home down payment</span></button><button class="fp-add" type="button" data-add-goal="Car"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H136v80a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h80V40a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v80h80A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"/></svg><span>Car</span></button><button class="fp-add" type="button" data-add-goal="School"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H136v80a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h80V40a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v80h80A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"/></svg><span>School</span></button><button class="fp-add" type="button" data-add-goal="Baby"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H136v80a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h80V40a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v80h80A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"/></svg><span>Baby</span></button><button class="fp-add" type="button" data-add-goal="Travel"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H136v80a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h80V40a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v80h80A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"/></svg><span>Travel</span></button><button class="fp-add" type="button" data-add-goal="Starting a business"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H136v80a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h80V40a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v80h80A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"/></svg><span>Starting a business</span></button><button class="fp-add" type="button" data-add-goal="Something else"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H136v80a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h80V40a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v80h80A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"/></svg><span>Something else</span></button></div></div><ul class="fp-goals" data-goals></ul><div class="fp-out" data-out="goals" aria-live="polite"></div><div class="fp-sub"><h3 class="fp-h3">How do you feel about risk?</h3><p class="fp-p">Five quick questions about the money you won’t need for at least five years. There are no wrong answers.</p><fieldset class="fp-field fp-q"><legend class="fp-label"><span class="fp-q__n">1</span>When will you need most of your long-term money?</legend><div class="fp-chips fp-chips--stack"><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="r1" value="1"><span>In under 5 years</span></label><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="r1" value="2"><span>In 5 to 10 years</span></label><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="r1" value="3"><span>In 10 to 20 years</span></label><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="r1" value="4"><span>In 20 years or more</span></label></div></fieldset><fieldset class="fp-field fp-q"><legend class="fp-label"><span class="fp-q__n">2</span>If you lost your income, how long could you cover bills without selling investments?</legend><div class="fp-chips fp-chips--stack"><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="r2" value="1"><span>Under 3 months</span></label><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="r2" value="2"><span>3 to 6 months</span></label><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="r2" value="3"><span>6 to 12 months</span></label><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="r2" value="4"><span>More than a year</span></label></div></fieldset><fieldset class="fp-field fp-q"><legend class="fp-label"><span class="fp-q__n">3</span>You invest $10,000. A month later it’s worth $7,000. What do you do?</legend><div class="fp-chips fp-chips--stack"><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="r3" value="1"><span>Sell everything</span></label><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="r3" value="2"><span>Sell some</span></label><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="r3" value="3"><span>Wait it out</span></label><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="r3" value="4"><span>Buy more</span></label></div></fieldset><fieldset class="fp-field fp-q"><legend class="fp-label"><span class="fp-q__n">4</span>Which would you pick for one year?</legend><div class="fp-chips fp-chips--stack"><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="r4" value="1"><span>$10,300, guaranteed</span></label><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="r4" value="2"><span>Anywhere from $9,500 to $11,000</span></label><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="r4" value="3"><span>Anywhere from $9,000 to $12,000</span></label><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="r4" value="4"><span>Anywhere from $8,000 to $14,000</span></label></div></fieldset><fieldset class="fp-field fp-q"><legend class="fp-label"><span class="fp-q__n">5</span>Have you invested before?</legend><div class="fp-chips fp-chips--stack"><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="r5" value="1"><span>Never</span></label><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="r5" value="2"><span>A little</span></label><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="r5" value="3"><span>For a few years</span></label><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="r5" value="4"><span>Yes, through a market crash</span></label></div></fieldset></div><div class="fp-out" data-out="risk" aria-live="polite"></div></div><div class="fp-nav"><button class="btn btn--ghost" type="button" data-back><svg class="icon icon--back" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H59.31l58.35,58.34a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,11.32l-72-72a8,8,0,0,1,0-11.32l72-72a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32L59.31,120H216A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"/></svg><span class="btn__text">Back</span></button><span class="fp-nav__count">Step 5 of 8</span><button class="btn btn--blue" type="button" data-next><span class="btn__text">Next</span><svg class="icon icon--next" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M221.66,133.66l-72,72a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L196.69,136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H196.69L138.34,61.66a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32l72,72A8,8,0,0,1,221.66,133.66Z"/></svg></button></div></section><section class="fp-step" id="fp-step-retire" data-step="retire" aria-labelledby="fp-step-retire-h"><h2 class="fp-step__h" id="fp-step-retire-h" tabindex="-1">Find the free money first</h2><p class="fp-step__lead">If your employer matches what you put into a retirement plan, that match is usually the best return you can get.</p><div class="fp-step__body"><fieldset class="fp-field" aria-describedby="fp-plan_offered-help"><legend class="fp-label">Does your job offer a retirement plan?</legend><p class="fp-help" id="fp-plan_offered-help">A 401(k), 403(b), 457(b), TSP, or SIMPLE IRA all count.</p><div class="fp-chips"><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="plan_offered" value="yes"><span>Yes</span></label><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="plan_offered" value="no"><span>No</span></label><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="plan_offered" value="unsure"><span>Not sure</span></label></div></fieldset><div data-show="plan_offered=yes" hidden><fieldset class="fp-field" aria-describedby="fp-match-help"><legend class="fp-label">How does your employer match?</legend><p class="fp-help" id="fp-match-help">Check your benefits site or ask HR for the plan summary.</p><div class="fp-chips fp-chips--stack"><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="match" value="none"><span>No match</span></label><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="match" value="safe"><span>100% of the first 3%, then 50% of the next 2%</span></label><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="match" value="half6"><span>50% of the first 6%</span></label><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="match" value="full4"><span>100% of the first 4%</span></label><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="match" value="full5"><span>100% of the first 5%</span></label><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="match" value="full6"><span>100% of the first 6%</span></label><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="match" value="unsure"><span>Not sure</span></label></div></fieldset><div class="fp-field "><label class="fp-label" for="fp-contrib">How much of each paycheck goes in now?</label><p class="fp-help" id="fp-contrib-help">Enter it as a share of your pay, like 3 for 3%.</p><div class="fp-money fp-money--suffix"><input class="fp-input" id="fp-contrib" name="contrib" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="fp-contrib-help"><span class="fp-money__suffix" aria-hidden="true">%</span></div></div><fieldset class="fp-field" aria-describedby="fp-vesting-help"><legend class="fp-label">When is the match fully yours?</legend><p class="fp-help" id="fp-vesting-help">Your own contributions are always yours. The match can take time.</p><div class="fp-chips"><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="vesting" value="now"><span>Right away</span></label><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="vesting" value="cliff"><span>All at once after a few years</span></label><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="vesting" value="graded"><span>A little more each year</span></label><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="vesting" value="unsure"><span>Not sure</span></label></div></fieldset><fieldset class="fp-field"><legend class="fp-label">Does the plan offer a Roth 401(k)?</legend><div class="fp-chips"><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="roth401k" value="yes"><span>Yes</span></label><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="roth401k" value="no"><span>No</span></label><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="roth401k" value="unsure"><span>Not sure</span></label></div></fieldset></div><fieldset class="fp-field"><legend class="fp-label">Are you on a high-deductible health plan with an HSA?</legend><div class="fp-chips"><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="hsa" value="yes"><span>Yes</span></label><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="hsa" value="no"><span>No</span></label><label class="fp-chip"><input type="radio" name="hsa" value="unsure"><span>Not sure</span></label></div></fieldset><div class="fp-out" data-out="match" aria-live="polite"></div><div class="fp-out" data-out="order" aria-live="polite"></div></div><div class="fp-nav"><button class="btn btn--ghost" type="button" data-back><svg class="icon icon--back" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H59.31l58.35,58.34a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,11.32l-72-72a8,8,0,0,1,0-11.32l72-72a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32L59.31,120H216A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"/></svg><span class="btn__text">Back</span></button><span class="fp-nav__count">Step 6 of 8</span><button class="btn btn--blue" type="button" data-next><span class="btn__text">Next</span><svg class="icon icon--next" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M221.66,133.66l-72,72a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L196.69,136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H196.69L138.34,61.66a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32l72,72A8,8,0,0,1,221.66,133.66Z"/></svg></button></div></section><section class="fp-step" id="fp-step-invest" data-step="invest" aria-labelledby="fp-step-invest-h"><h2 class="fp-step__h" id="fp-step-invest-h" tabindex="-1">Decide how much to invest</h2><p class="fp-step__lead">A common target is 15% of your pay before taxes for retirement, counting your employer’s match.</p><div class="fp-step__body"><div class="fp-out" data-out="invest" aria-live="polite"></div><div class="fp-out" data-out="mix" aria-live="polite"></div><div class="fp-sub"><h3 class="fp-h3">Ways to invest</h3><p class="fp-p">Once you know how much, you pick how. These are the main options, from least effort to most.</p><div class="fp-learns"><details class="fp-learn"><summary><span class="fp-learn__t">Target-date funds</span><svg class="icon fp-learn__caret" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"/></svg></summary><div class="fp-learn__b"><p>One fund holds a mix of stocks and bonds and gets more careful as its target year gets closer. It’s the default in many 401(k) plans.</p><p class="fp-learn__fit">Lowest effort. Check the yearly fee, called the expense ratio, since it varies a lot.</p></div></details><details class="fp-learn"><summary><span class="fp-learn__t">Index funds and ETFs</span><svg class="icon fp-learn__caret" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"/></svg></summary><div class="fp-learn__b"><p>One fund holds hundreds or thousands of companies by tracking a market index, so no single company can sink you.</p><p class="fp-learn__fit">Low effort, wide spread, and yearly fees that are often under 0.10%.</p></div></details><details class="fp-learn"><summary><span class="fp-learn__t">Robo-advisors</span><svg class="icon fp-learn__caret" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"/></svg></summary><div class="fp-learn__b"><p>An app asks about your goals, builds a portfolio of funds, and rebalances it for you.</p><p class="fp-learn__fit">Low effort outside a 401(k). Expect a fee of about 0.25% a year on top of the funds’ own fees.</p></div></details><details class="fp-learn"><summary><span class="fp-learn__t">Individual stocks</span><svg class="icon fp-learn__caret" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"/></svg></summary><div class="fp-learn__b"><p>You buy shares of one company at a time. It’s a good way to learn and a risky way to save.</p><p class="fp-learn__fit">High effort and little spread unless you own many. Many people keep this to a small slice, under 10%.</p></div></details></div><div class="fp-more"><div class="fp-more__item"><h4>Why fees matter</h4><p>A 1% yearly fee sounds small. On $500 a month for 30 years at a 6% return, you’d end up with about $80,000 less than with a 0.05% fee.</p></div><div class="fp-more__item"><h4>Investing on autopilot</h4><p>Putting the same amount in every payday, through ups and downs, means you buy more when prices drop. It also takes the guessing out.</p></div><div class="fp-more__item"><h4>Rebalancing</h4><p>Once a year, move money back to your target mix. If stocks had a great year, that means trimming them.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="fp-nav"><button class="btn btn--ghost" type="button" data-back><svg class="icon icon--back" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H59.31l58.35,58.34a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,11.32l-72-72a8,8,0,0,1,0-11.32l72-72a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32L59.31,120H216A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"/></svg><span class="btn__text">Back</span></button><span class="fp-nav__count">Step 7 of 8</span><button class="btn btn--blue" type="button" data-next><span class="btn__text">Next</span><svg class="icon icon--next" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M221.66,133.66l-72,72a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L196.69,136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H196.69L138.34,61.66a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32l72,72A8,8,0,0,1,221.66,133.66Z"/></svg></button></div></section><section class="fp-step" id="fp-step-plan" data-step="plan" aria-labelledby="fp-step-plan-h"><h2 class="fp-step__h" id="fp-step-plan-h" tabindex="-1">Here’s your plan</h2><p class="fp-step__lead">These are your next moves, in order. Do the first one this week.</p><div class="fp-step__body"><div class="fp-out" data-out="actions"></div><div class="fp-out" data-out="numbers"></div><form class="fp-gate" data-gate novalidate action="https://formspree.io/f/xrppvnyn" method="POST"><span class="fp-gate__glow" aria-hidden="true"></span><h3 class="fp-gate__h">Take your plan with you</h3><p class="fp-gate__p">Get everything above as a PDF you can print, save, or check off.</p><div class="fp-gate__row"><label class="sr-only" for="fp-email">Email address</label><input class="fp-gate__input" id="fp-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" inputmode="email" required placeholder="Email address"><button class="btn btn--white fp-gate__btn" type="submit"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M224,144v64a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H40a8,8,0,0,1-8-8V144a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v56H208V144a8,8,0,0,1,16,0Zm-101.66,5.66a8,8,0,0,0,11.32,0l40-40a8,8,0,0,0-11.32-11.32L136,124.69V32a8,8,0,0,0-16,0v92.69L93.66,98.34a8,8,0,0,0-11.32,11.32Z"/></svg><span class="btn__text">Get my PDF</span></button></div><p class="fp-gate__trap" aria-hidden="true"><label>Leave this empty <input type="text" name="_gotcha" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label></p><p class="fp-gate__status" data-gate-status role="status"></p><p class="fp-gate__note"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M208,80H176V56a48,48,0,0,0-96,0V80H48A16,16,0,0,0,32,96V208a16,16,0,0,0,16,16H208a16,16,0,0,0,16-16V96A16,16,0,0,0,208,80ZM96,56a32,32,0,0,1,64,0V80H96ZM208,208H48V96H208V208Z"/></svg><span>Only your email is sent, and only to me. Your numbers stay in this browser and go straight into the PDF.</span></p><button class="fp-link fp-link--light" type="button" data-again hidden><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M224,144v64a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H40a8,8,0,0,1-8-8V144a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v56H208V144a8,8,0,0,1,16,0Zm-101.66,5.66a8,8,0,0,0,11.32,0l40-40a8,8,0,0,0-11.32-11.32L136,124.69V32a8,8,0,0,0-16,0v92.69L93.66,98.34a8,8,0,0,0-11.32,11.32Z"/></svg><span>Download again</span></button></form></div><div class="fp-nav"><button class="btn btn--ghost" type="button" data-back><svg class="icon icon--back" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H59.31l58.35,58.34a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,11.32l-72-72a8,8,0,0,1,0-11.32l72-72a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32L59.31,120H216A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"/></svg><span class="btn__text">Back</span></button><span class="fp-nav__count">Step 8 of 8</span></div></section></div><aside class="fp-sum" aria-labelledby="fp-sum-h"><div class="fp-sum__card"><h2 class="fp-sum__h" id="fp-sum-h">Your plan so far</h2><div data-summary><p class="fp-sum__empty">Your numbers show up here as you go.</p></div></div></aside></div><section class="wrap fp-foot"><p class="fp-disclaimer">For learning only. This isn’t financial, tax, or legal advice, and I’m not a licensed advisor. The planner never recommends a specific fund, stock, or brokerage. Rules of thumb are a starting point, so check big decisions with a professional.</p><h2 class="fp-foot__h">Where the numbers come from</h2><ul class="fp-src"><li><span class="fp-src__k">Cost of living</span><a href="https://www.bea.gov/data/prices-inflation/regional-price-parities-state-and-metro-area" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">BEA Regional Price Parities, 2024 data, released February 19, 2026<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></li><li><span class="fp-src__k">ZIP codes to areas</span><a href="https://www.census.gov/geographies/reference-files/time-series/geo/relationship-files.2020.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Census 2020 ZIP code to county file and OMB 2023 metro areas<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></li><li><span class="fp-src__k">Retirement limits</span><a href="https://www.irs.gov/newsroom/401k-limit-increases-to-24500-for-2026-ira-limit-increases-to-7500" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">IRS 20